    "chunk_text": ". \u00deonne ys to gelyfenne \u00fe\u00e6t hyt cume him to godre are. Gif men innan wyrmas eglen genim w\u00e6gbredan seaw, cnuca & wring & syle him supan. & nim \u00f0a sylfan wyrte, gecnuca, lege on \u00feone naflan & wri\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6rto swy\u00f0e f\u00e6ste. Gif hwylces mannes lichoma sy aheardod nim \u00feonne wegbr\u00e6dan \u00fea wyrte & gecnuca wi\u00f0 smeru Hnesca\u00fe hyt sona & bata\u00fe. Gif hwylcum men sy \u00fe\u00e6s feor\u00f0an d\u00e6ges fefer getenge genim \u00f0onne \u00fe\u00e6re wyrte seaw, cnid on \u00deonne ys wen \u00fe\u00e6t hyt him cume to mycelre freme. Wi\u00f0 fotadle & wi\u00f0 sina sare genim \u00feonne w\u00e6gbr\u00e6dan leaf, gnid wi\u00f0 sealt, sete \u00f0onne on \u00fea fet & on \u00deonne ys \u00fe\u00e6t gewisslice l\u00e6cedom. Wi\u00f0 \u00feam fefore \u00fee \u00f0y \u00feriddan d\u00e6ge on man becyme\u00f0 genim wegbr\u00e6dan \u00fery cy\u00f0as, cnid on w\u00e6tere Wi\u00fe \u00f0y fefore \u00fee \u00f0y \u00e6ftran d\u00e6ge to cyme\u00f0 gecnuca \u00feas ylcan wyrte swy\u00fee smale, syle him on ealo\u00f0 \u00de\u00e6t ys to gelyfenne \u00fe\u00e6t hit dyge. Wi\u00f0 wunda hatunge nim \u00feonne wegbr\u00e6dan \u00fea wyrt, cnuca on smerwe butan sealte, lege on \u00fea wunde. \u00deonne bi\u00f0 he sona hal. Gif mannes fet on sy\u00fee tydrien genim \u00feonne wegbr\u00e6den \u00f0a wyrt, gnid on ecede, be\u00fee \u00f0a fet \u00fe\u00e6rmid \u00d0onne \u00fewine\u00fe hy sona. Gif hwylcum weargbr\u00e6de weaxe",
